# Direct pip dependencies for task-runner image
#
# Add packages here and regenerate requirements.txt with:
#   make pip-requirements
#
# Only add direct dependencies - transitive dependencies will be
# resolved automatically when regenerating requirements.txt.
#
# Always pin to specific versions, this gives Renovate something to update
# (else the resolved requirements.txt would never get updated).

